  },
  "consumer_commands": "The two original consumer command.json/check.json records are copied verbatim; they are attributed to the consumer lane, not reruns by this kernel author.",
  "root_decision": "Keep both independent kernels age rules and Take/Store order unchanged. Frontend author will examine the existing retained outer-slot lowering route as a separate238 proposal. Do not change236 inputs or cleanup oracle to hide the failure.",
  "implementation_change": false,
  "semantic_limits": [
    "No exemption for repeated Store and no LocalId-based cleanup ordering was added.",
    "A generic stable-rank exception would need explicit semantics and could not preserve first-initialization rank by changing Store alone, because Take/Drop already forget old edges.",
    "Nested Product wrappers must retain independent field completeness, actual source projections and prepare-before-replace. This investigation does not declare the238 lowering implemented or safe."
